  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 201.02 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to actions arising under RSA 482-A.\n\nSource. #2271, eff 1-10-83; ss by #2924, eff 12-11-84, EXPIRED: 12-11-90\n\nNew. #5028, eff 12-20-90; ss by #6404, INTERIM, eff 12-21-96, EXPIRED: 4-20-97\n\nNew. #6498-B, eff 4-23-97, EXPIRED: 4-23-05\n\nNew. #8341, eff 4-25-05 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 200); ss by #10366-A, eff 6-26-13; ss by #12802, eff 12-15-19 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 200)",
